      "standardized_narrative": "At 31 December 2021 the syndicate held gross claims outstanding of GBP 1,787.9m (opening balance GBP 1,775.2m). Within the calendar year technical result there was a net release on prior accident years of GBP 33.737m (reported as a surplus relating to reassessment of net claims incurred for prior years). The release reflects broadly favourable claims development and reserve releases across a number of classes driven by benign attritional experience and favourable back-year experience; prior years (notably the 2019 year) remain impacted historically by COVID-19 and major weather events such as Storm Dorian.",
